e to meet you, my name is Choko Hoshimiya, a personal Vtuber!\n\nI saw your wonderful illustration on Twitter, and I would like to ask you to do the same for me, so I sent a request to you!\n\n  Illustration details\nI would like to request a standing picture of Choko Hoshimiya from the first page of the attached URL.\n\nI would appreciate it if you could draw her as close as possible and not cut off her head.\nI would like an illustration of her playing a PC game wearing headphones in a dark neon-like decorated room.\n(For reference, the headphones, mouse and keyboard are from Logitech's Aurora Collection.)\nClothing -> I would like you to use the same clothing as in the standing illustration!\nThe rabbit's ears are attached to a hat, so if you take off the hat, please remove the ears as well.\n\nI would appreciate it if you could give me a drawing that is at least 3000x3000 with a transparent background.\n\nUsage.\nSNS, thumbnails, free distribution of fan boxes, etc.\n\nWe know you are busy, but thank you in advance!\n\nhttps://twitter.com/chocomaaashu/status/1567916298621034496?s=46&t=KpzIvM2k9s9iR2VXeSHT5Q", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@matsukaze_tiyo/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2625371, "client_id": 2540637, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ffca4806/uploads/origins/523bf11c-e032-4dff-8dfa-0cd7f19b02cc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ffa80c1f990dce2f59d282da55f907f2", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ffca4806/uploads/origins/523bf11c-e032-4dff-8dfa-0cd7f19b02cc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ffa80c1f990dce2f59d282da55f907f2, https://si.imgix.net/ffca4806/uploads/origins/523bf11c-e032-4dff-8dfa-0cd7f19b02cc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7b020378198ba97f8a96626094c053ac 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ffca4806/uploads/origins/523bf11c-e032-4dff-8dfa-0cd7f19b02cc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a3b87eec24feda39eedf53fc71ca446a 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ffca4806/uploads/origins/523bf11c-e032-4dff-8dfa-0cd7f19b02cc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0134b4ea5c38f963868adbc851fabd83", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ffca4806/uploads/origins/523bf11c-e032-4dff-8dfa-0cd7f19b02cc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0134b4ea5c38f963868adbc851fabd83, https://si.imgix.net/ffca4806/uploads/origins/523bf11c-e032-4dff-8dfa-0cd7f19b02cc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0b56f4d69cdfbf7c4bfafe784972fae7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ffca4806/uploads/origins/523bf11c-e032-4dff-8dfa-0cd7f19b02cc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=86671d87aee4cf2bb9a2562b09c6d8ec 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you, Mr. Matukaze.\nI would like you to draw me a VTUBER, Mai Koinoyo!\n\nRequests:\nhttps://twitter.com/matsukaze_tiyo/status/1607738271228100608?s=46&t=lUdgRM1ZIyd3sw0cmPdS8w\nI would like to request Matukaze to draw an illustration similar to this one (beautiful, calming to look at).\n\nOutfit: If possible, I'd like it to be something else, not what Mai Koinoiya is wearing right now!\n\nI would like to leave the specific hairstyle, pose, composition, etc. to Matukaze-sama.\n\n\nIntended use:\nKoino Yomai's own activities (thumbnails for YouTube and other video distribution sites, Twitter announcements, etc.)\n\nReferences:\nhttps://twitter.com/koinoya_mai/status/1552320390416183296?s=46&t=PpAG1m3XABkzSMfr-cpePg\n\nDelivery Format:\nWe would appreciate it if you could separate the characters and backgrounds into separate layers, as we may use only the characters as material.\n\nThank you in advance for your consideration!", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@matsukaze_tiyo/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2625371, "client_id": 1467, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3f8250df/uploads/origins/480bb655-fb5d-4744-b792-33be7213fd22?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=790c7a7383483e77380546a9cc0587f0", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3f8250df/uploads/origins/480bb655-fb5d-4744-b792-33be7213fd22?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=790c7a7383483e77380546a9cc0587f0, https://si.imgix.net/3f8250df/uploads/origins/480bb655-fb5d-4744-b792-33be7213fd22?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1002b8b95422d1f9a4bd42f090532845 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3f8250df/uploads/origins/480bb655-fb5d-4744-b792-33be7213fd22?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0875a755beab31eccf44d8f69b6efc66 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3f8250df/uploads/origins/480bb655-fb5d-4744-b792-33be7213fd22?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4958f132cb6e8f7d858c4c27c7947f25", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3f8250df/uploads/origins/480bb655-fb5d-4744-b792-33be7213fd22?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4958f132cb6e8f7d858c4c27c7947f25, https://si.imgix.net/3f8250df/uploads/origins/480bb655-fb5d-4744-b792-33be7213fd22?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=537bf12e9082c529d558978cce5ed526 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3f8250df/uploads/origins/480bb655-fb5d-4744-b792-33be7213fd22?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=00cde0f4056bf735de743628a87fb7b7 3x"}, "body": "Hello, my name is Tsukikageiro.\nI saw your wonderful illustration on the list of new creators and sent you a request.\n\nI would like to submit a request for my fox sister \"Midorin\".\nThe design is as shown in the reference material, and the costume should be the \"formal wear\" shown in the material.\nIf there is anything unclear or difficult to understand, please feel free to draw it in a way that is easy for you to understand.\n\nWe would like to create an image of the cherry blossom season a little ahead of the season, and leave all poses and facial expressions to the artist.\nWe will also leave it up to you whether or not she is equipped with jewelry or a fan.\n\nWe would be happy if the address can be turned on/off in the PSD layer.\nThank you in advance for your consideration.\n\n\nCharacter materials (including standing drawings, three-dimensional drawings, and notes)\nURL: https://twitter.com/Tukikagerou/status/1586588803682119680?s=20&t=avLf_nZfVY2WEbnfKO5Wmw\n(Please note that the one green point on the ears and the tip of the twin tails can easily be overlooked.)\n\n\nCharacter materials (preliminary URL): https://min.togetter.com/VrQdsKr\n\nList of deliveries to date : https://min.togetter.com/Gyo3MrY", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@matsukaze_tiyo/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2625371, "client_id": 1815882, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e49a4dc0/uploads/origins/8368dd3a-05ef-44c6-8968-2dfca9a803af?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=52f0cf22cf1407ea8b23c70c03a86547", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e49a4dc0/uploads/origins/8368dd3a-05ef-44c6-8968-2dfca9a803af?bg=%23fff&au